WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.200
It's a hidden dragon world.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.200
Wow

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.340
There were dragons when I was a boy

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.379
Where they went only a few know

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:24.000
Our story changed the world forever

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.400
We did it!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.400
The world's first dragon-viking utopia

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.900
Your utopia, maybe. Mine's less crowded and more- ah!- sanitary

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Hey, Bud, wait up!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.300
Oh my gods

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:45.900
He's not the only one

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
She's a light fury

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.600
Oh, sorry

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.700
Did she just disappear?

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.600
Wow

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.610
It's a hidden dragon world

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:08.730
Toothless, go introduce yourself

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.070
Toothless has a girlfriend

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:29.900
I've hunted every Night Fury except yours. Hand him over

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.720
I will never give him up

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.620
Then I will destroy everything you love

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:45.510
We are no longer safe here. We all have to disappear completely off the map. We have to fight for their freedom

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:50.500
Come on, Bud

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.000
You're nothing without your dragon

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:53.900
Attack

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:58.230
Show them what you got, Bud

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Yeah

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.800
Save him

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:13.029
It's you and me, Bud. Always

